                "text_J9HNcn": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Anna’s earliest memories are of life in Northern New Mexico, among the splendid high desert environs and the Native American cultures of the Four Corners area. Each had a profound impact on her life as an artist, and informed how she sees the world and our place within it.</p><p>Partnering on initiatives that aim to preserve and protect the cultural heritage and landscape of the Southwest have become deeply important to the brand.</p>",
